  "globalInvariants": [
    "A confirmed MATERIAL or CRITICAL supervision escape forces Mission Control assurance FAIL even when lower-level worker/task planes are GREEN.",
    "A system finding/correction that predates owner detection prevents false owner-first classification.",
    "New owner requirements, new external facts, and reserved owner decisions are not supervision escapes merely because the owner supplied them.",
    "Codex and deterministic code never infer semantic owner-intervention disposition, materiality, or detectability from free text.",
    "Repeated materially equivalent escape after a VERIFIED repair is evidence the repair failed.",
    "Failure of the assurance plane is repaired by redesigning that plane, never by adding another supervisory layer."
  ]
}
